              "message": "=Score this job candidate using these exact rules.\n\nEXPERIENCE SCORE (0–50): 5 points per year of IT experience, maximum 50.\n\nSKILLS SCORE (0–50): add points for every skill the candidate has:\n- Core skills, 10 points each: n8n, Claude Code, Ollama, Python\n- Relevant skills, 5 points each: Codex, OpenClaw, Hermes, Stability Matrix, Linux Ubuntu\n- Any other technical skill, or knowledge of working with sofware instrumnets 2 points each\nCount each skill once, ignore upper/lower case. Maximum 50.\n\ntotalScore = experienceScore + skillsScore.\nIn \"reasoning\", list which skills earned points and how many.\n\nCandidate:\nYears of IT experience: {{ $json.output.yearsOfExperience }}\nSkills: {{ $json.output.skills.join(', ') }}\nWork summary: {{ $json.output.workSummary }}"
            }
          ]
